ear=451">Open the atlas at 451 CE &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure>
<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/roman-egypt"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Roman%20Egypt.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Roman Egypt</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Council of Chalcedon; most Egyptian Christians reject its creed</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/franks"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Franks.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Franks</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Franks fight with Aetius at the Battle of the Catalaunian Plains</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/caucasian-albania"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Caucasian%20Albania.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Caucasian Albania</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Albanians join the Armenian rising crushed at the Battle of Avarayr</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/alans"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Alans.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Alans</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Alans under Sangiban fight Attila at the Catalaunian Plains</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/hunnic-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Hunnic%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Hunnic Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Attila's forces enter Gaul, attack Metz and besiege Orléans; a combined Roman and Visigothic army fights them at the Battle of the Catalaunian Plains.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/visigothic-kingdom"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Visigothic%20Kingdom.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Visigothic Kingdom</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Theodoric I fights under Flavius Aetius against Attila at the Battle of the Catalaunian Plains and is killed as the Huns are driven back.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-the-catalaunian-plains"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20the%20Catalaunian%20Plains.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of the Catalaunian Plains</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Attila crosses the Rhine and sacks Divodurum (Metz) on 7 April</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-the-catalaunian-plains"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20the%20Catalaunian%20Plains.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of the Catalaunian Plains</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Attila's final assault on Aurelianum on 14 June is broken off as the Roman coalition approaches</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-the-catalaunian-plains"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20the%20Catalaunian%20Plains.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of the Catalaunian Plains</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Thorismund returns to Tolosa and becomes king of the Visigoths, while Attila leaves Gaul</span></li></ul></section>
